      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    working_capital = 240000\n    total_assets = 1200000\n    retained_earnings = 350000\n    ebit = 150000\n    market_value_of_equity = 850000\n    total_liabilities = 600000\n    sales = 750000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    a = working_capital / total_assets\n    b = retained_earnings / total_assets\n    c = ebit / total_assets\n    d = market_value_of_equity / total_liabilities\n    e = sales / total_assets\n\n    z_score = 1.2 * a + 1.4 * b + 3.3 * c + 0.6 * d + e\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(z_score, 2)\n```",
